            <h2>About The WildLife Safari</h2>
            <p>WildLife Safari is a responsible adventure travel company based in Chitwan National Park, Nepal. Established in 2017, we specialize in eco-friendly wildlife tours, bird watching, and community-based experiences. Guided by certified experts, we are committed to conservation, ethical tourism, and supporting local communities through education and social initiatives.<p>
