                    <p>We focus on community-led, conservation-driven tourism where your journey directly contributes to protecting wildlife and supporting local livelihoods.</p>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Is it safe to travel with local guides?</summary>
                    <p>Absolutely! Our local guides are professionally trained, deeply knowledgeable about the area, and committed to providing you a safe, enriching experience.</p>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>How is the 20% contribution to conservation used?</summary>
                    <p>We invest in local conservation initiatives, including supporting Community-Based Anti-Poaching Units (CBAPUs), habitat restoration, and environmental education.</p>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>What's the best time to visit?</summary>
                    <p>The ideal time is between October and March when the weather is pleasant, wildlife sightings are more frequent, and local festivals add cultural richness to your journey.</p>
                </details>

                <details>
                    <summary>Is pickup and drop-off service available?</summary>
                    <p>Yes, we offer reliable pickup and drop-off services from nearby towns or transportation hubs. Just let us know your travel details in advance.</p>
